---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Uzalishaji na Viwandani — BOM, Amri za Uzalishaji, Udhibiti wa Ubora"
  description="Orodha za malighafi, usimamizi wa mapishi, amri za uzalishaji, ufuatiliaji wa kazi katika maendeleo, udhibiti wa ubora, uthibitisho wa mizigo na uchambuzi wa mavuno. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/uzalishaji/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">Uzalishaji na Viwandani</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>Uzalishaji na Viwandani</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Kutoka mapishi hadi bidhaa za mwisho. Fuatilia malighafi, amri za uzalishaji, ukaguzi wa ubora na mavuno — na kila gharama ikihesabiwa kwa otomatiki.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Wakurugenzi wa viwandani, wasimamizi wa uzalishaji, wadhibiti ubora na viongozi wanaozalisha au kubadilisha bidhaa. Iwe unayo kiwanda cha usindikaji wa chakula, laini ya ufungashaji au warsha, moduli hii inasimamia mzunguko wa uzalishaji.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Mapishi / Orodha za Malighafi</h3><p>Fafanua orodha za malighafi na viambato, idadi, mavuno yatarajiwa na hatua za usindikaji. Toleo la mapishi linafuatiliwa.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Amri za Uzalishaji</h3><p>Tengeneza amri dhidi ya mapishi. Fuatilia hali kutoka imepangwa hadi imeanza hadi imekamilika. Malighafi inatumika na bidhaa za mwisho zinapokelewa kwa otomatiki.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ufuatiliaji wa Kazi Katika Maendeleo</h3><p>Fuatilia malighafi inayotumika na gharama zilizokusanywa wakati wa uzalishaji. Maandishi ya kazi katika maendeleo kwenye kitabu kikuu.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Udhibiti wa Ubora</h3><p>Mifano ya ukaguzi na vigezo vya kukubali. Rekodi matokeo kwa kila mizigo. Kubali au kataa mizigo kulingana na matokeo ya udhibiti wa ubora.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Uthibitisho wa Mizigo</h3><p>Thibitisha mizigo ya uzalishaji kwa ajili ya kutolewa. Rekodi mamlaka, tarehe na masharti. Mizigo iliyothibitishwa tu ndiyo huenda kwenye hisa za bidhaa za mwisho.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Uchambuzi wa Mavuno</h3><p>Linganisha mavuno yaliyopangwa dhidi ya yaliyopatikana. Fuatilia taka, na bidhaa za pembe. Tambua mapungufu kwa mapishi, kituo au kipindi.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona uzalishaji kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa mazingira yako ya uzalishaji.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
